@format 1
@id preview.close-media
@title Close media
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Dispose active playback state, clear preview transformations, and clear the connected timeline.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge, Funnel
@flow TB
@related preview.open-media
@tag media
@tag close

@alias viewer = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PViewer
@alias window = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainWindow.PWindow
@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow

[input] Close media request <input>
- Receive the viewer close command @ viewer.PViewerMediaClose(...)
> eligible

[eligible] Check active media <decision>
- Confirm that the viewer is active and holds a source or media record @ viewer.PViewerMediaClose(...)
? "Media is active" > clear
? "Nothing is open" > unchanged

[clear] Clear preview <process>
- Stop and dispose the player @ viewer.PViewerMediaClose(...)
- Clear source, media, crop, and playback state @ viewer.PViewerMediaClose(...)
- Publish an empty media status @ viewer.PViewerMediaClose(...)
> timeline

[timeline] Clear timeline <output>
- Receive the empty media status @ window.PWindowMediaHandle(...)
- Clear timeline models, views, keyframes, waveform, and selection @ flow.PFlowClear(...)
= No media remains active in the preview or timeline.

[unchanged] No change <output>
= Existing empty state is unchanged.
